description: |-
  Retrieves timeline records from a Cortex case based on filter criteria.
  Returns record details including Type, Record Name, Source, Evidence status, and timestamps.
  Multiple filters are combined with AND logic. If no filters are specified, all records are returned.
  Note: This action may return partial results based on pagination limits.
display: Cortex - List Timeline Records
isdetailsoverridden: false
locked: false
name: CortexListTimelineRecords
